        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 802ADH, Ashfield Dummy Cylinder Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis stylish entryset features edged rectangular mounts. Ashfield handleset is made by Kwikset and is backed by a lifetime finish warranty. Solid brass construction ensures it last for many years to come. Good for 1-3/4\" thick doors with 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets. A dummy cylinder handleset is non-functional. Just for looks, it is used on inactive doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dummy Cylinder Handleset:</b> is non-functional. Just for looks, it is used on inactive doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/ashfield-single-cylinder-handleset-kwikset-800adh\"><b>Ashfield Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Ashfield Dummy Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li> Polymer coating.</li>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass with solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 802ADH Ashfield Door Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Length Overall: 17-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-21/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Length: 14-11/25\"</li>\r\n<li>Center of Deadbolt to Center of Top Plate: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center of Latch to Center of Throughbolt: 8-13/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: please specify</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis handleset is customisable with a huge selection of interior trim knobs and levers and additional finish color options just <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> for all the options! \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Ashfield Dummy Cylinder Handleset, Kwikset 802ADH",
                "description": "Ashfield Dummy Cylinder Handleset Kwikset 802ADH - This stylish entryset features edged rectangular mounts. Ashfield handleset is made by Kwikset and is backed by a lifetime mechanical warranty. Solid brass construction ensures it last for many years to come. Good for 1-3/4 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. A dummy cylinder handleset is non-functional. Just for looks, it is used on inactive doors.",
